{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e93eabd0-4ba4-8015-afd0-2480c8f24a09",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T13:40:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Um, hold on, let me put this down. [pause] Okay. I'm calling for my father, he's the one who, he wants to sell things this summer. From a truck, a little cart, I'm not sure which."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. So that sounds like a mobile vendor license. Is that what you're asking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mobile, yes, that's the word he used. A mobile vendor license. For summer. Is that a thing you do here, or is it some other office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We handle those here, yes. Licensing goes through the clerk's office. Can I ask, is it a food truck, or a cart, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's, sorry, I'm looking for the paper he gave me. [pause] It's, um, he says a cart. Maybe a truck later. I don't know. Does that matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:39:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can matter, because the rules may be a little different for each. Take your time. If you're not sure, we can note it as a cart for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:39:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A cart, okay. And what's the fee? What does it cost, the license?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fee depends on the type of vendor and how long the license runs. I don't have the exact amount in front of me, so I'd rather have you get the right figure from the licensing application. I can mail one or you can pick it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail, no, wait, he's, I'm at the house on Malbone Road, twenty-one Malbone. Could you send it there? Or is that, do I need to say it slower?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. Twenty-one Malbone Road. And the name on it, is that your father's?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Costa. Yes. I'm Luis, he's also, well, it's the same last name. Sorry, I'm all over the place today. They have a half day at school this Wednesday and it threw the whole week off, I was supposed to call yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:40:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, you're calling today. So I'll send the application to Costa, twenty-one Malbone Road. It'll list the fee and what documents he needs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And if I have a question when it comes, I call this number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this same number. Ask for the clerk's office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the cart, and the fee is on the paper. I think I got that. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T13:40:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
